{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"几何表示论"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“几何表示论”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#几何表示论</p>\n<h2>基础知识</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴O","text":"范畴 O"}},{"Plain":" 的不可约对象为 $L_\\lambda\\,(\\lambda \\in\\mathfrak h^*)$.</p>\n<h3>块理论</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴O","text":"范畴 O"}},{"Plain":" 被 $\\operatorname{Spec}Z(\\mathfrak g)$ 划分许多 “"},{"Local":{"url":"块","text":"块 (范畴 O)"}},{"Plain":"” (blocks):\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O\\simeq \\bigoplus_{\\chi\\colon Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to\\mathbb{C}} \\mathcal O_{\\chi}.\r\n$$\n对任意对象 $M\\in\\mathcal O$, 有 $\\operatorname{dim}_{\\mathbb{C}}(Z(\\mathfrak g)/\\operatorname{Ann}M)&lt;+\\infty$, 且 $\\operatorname{supp}M$ 是有限个离散点. 特别地, 对于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Verma模","text":"Verma 模"}},{"Plain":" $M_\\lambda$, $\\operatorname{Ann}M_\\lambda$ 是极大理想, 即 $Z(\\mathfrak g)$ 以某个特征 $\\chi\\colon Z(\\mathfrak g)\\to\\mathbb{C}$ 作用于 $M_\\lambda$.</p>\n"}]}}